(21,[[694,715]],'Weather duration is 5 for fixed requests, otherwise permanent (−1); active holder items can extend only positive duration. Same-weather request returns before writes. Weather animation comes from BattleWeather registry, suppression changes effective weather separately.','WP45 weather duration and registry animation'),
(38,[[175,204]],'Affection survival is inside damage≥currentHP after damage is clamped to currentHP; its branch requires damage==totalHP, hence full HP. Nonlethal/Endure come earlier; substitute/disguise/iceface return earlier.','WP46 lethal damage and affection'),
(44,[[1307,1310]],'Hidden Power type pool is ordered by icon position, then registry insertion among ties; excludes pseudo/Normal/Shadow but permits Fairy; flattened compact pool feeds parity index.','WP43 Hidden Power type data'),
(48,[[143,165],[745,767],[853,930],[1073,1125]],'Ghost Curse target is random near foe at generation≥8, selected near foe earlier. Copycat adds forced-switch families to blacklist at≥6. Nature Power maps grass toEnergyBall vsSeedBomb, cavePowerGem vsRockSlide, rock/sandEarthPower vsEarthquake, snow Blizzard≤5/FrostBreath6/IceBeam≥7; selected terrain has priority; only registered alternatives replace defaultTriAttack. Assist≥6 adds NaturePower, all listed two-turn families and Roar to blacklist and excludes eggs; pre6 eggs can supply moves. These are independent of data backup switching.','WP47A copied/called moves and environment; WP45 terrain'),
(49,[[257,279],[315,408],[795,817],[860,882]],'GripClaw binding duration stored8 at≥5, else6; ordinary duration5/6. MORE_TYPE_EFFECTS prevents Ghost targets from MeanLook normal/additional, ThousandWaves, Octolock and JawLock paths; it does not universally prohibit writing every trap effect. Encore adds six called-move families to blacklist at≥7. Taunt checks Oblivious immunity at≥6 unless MoldBreaker, after AromaVeil.','WP47B trapping/acting'),
