(51,[[38,60],[140,162]],'SUPER_SHINY chooses alternative animation only for already shiny battler with super flag and enabled battle animations, both wild intro and send-out paths; does not disable super-shiny individual state or force shininess.','WP67B presentation and WP19 state'),
(52,[[341,363],[386,408]],'Two AI switch-preservation handlers ignore Ghost foes when judging whether current ability/item can trap them under MORE_TYPE_EFFECTS; existing trapping/guaranteed switching checks also gate. Full handler identity/outer decision prerequisites remain to inspect.','WP51 AI switching'),
(53,[[1,78]],'AI HP-heal amounts switch SuperPotion/EnergyPowder60vs50, HyperPotion/EnergyRoot120vs200, FreshWater30vs50,Soda50vs60,Lemonade70vs80. RageCandyBar joins HP20 list onlyold, status cure list onlynew. Ordinary X items use2vs1 stages; numbered variants always2/3/6. Declared once when file loads; real item handlers separately checked.','WP51/WP52C AI item model and WP28 effects'),
