(56,[[387,411],[510,534],[567,591],[652,676],[727,749],[784,808],[864,898]],'Each of five pinch/confusion berries item ranking gets+2 in7,−3 in≤6, unchanged≥8; high skill nature dislike−2 keyed separately toSpDef/Attack/Defense/Speed/SpAtk. SoulDew onlyLati; type-mode requires damaging Psychic/Dragon, old gives10 with special move else6. Gem ranking+2 at≤5, but final0 if lacks damaging move of matching gem type.','WP51 item desirability and WP52C projections'),
(57,[[33,55]],'Wild smarter flag only consulted absent trainer record; if active wild species has Legendary/Mythical/UltraBeast flag, skill32 replaces initialized0. Actual trainer skill always wins.','WP51 skill model'),
