(61,[[196,218],[266,288],[973,1028],[1288,1310]],'Autotomize AI adds SkyDrop susceptibility−10 only≥6 and preweight2000..2999; Minimize vulnerability−15≥6 else−10. Defog predictive failure includes opposite hazards≥6 and terrain≥8, score removes corresponding hazards/terrain with switching predicates. PsychUp new-critical mode scores FocusEnergy/LaserFocus gains/losses ±5 only after at least one ordinary stat raise.','WP52A/52B scoring'),
