(63,[[561,583],[597,619],[777,799],[829,851],[853,875],[879,901],[931,953],[979,1001],[1111,1154],[1157,1179],[1333,1355]],'AI Mud/WaterSport failure uses global counter≥6 vs any battler flagold. Protection preference penalties multiply(ProtectRate−1) by15≥6 else10; KingsShield estimated Attackdrop1≥8else2. WideGuard scoring generation<7 checks outer move.damagingMove? rather than enumerated candidate, a local predictive asymmetry; no extrapolation to battle protection. LockOn scoring skips already-perfect Minimize hits only≥6.','WP52B protection/field scoring; exact handler scope remains current-clause comparison'),
